+++
title: Yomonsni Mission
+++

Yomonsni exists to help people like you to move forward, in the ways that you really want, from exactly where you actually are.

A part of this requires connecting and learning exactly where you are, but also needs to uncover with you, where you want to be going, and why. 


It's easy for any one of us to sit back and say we'd like to be, or have,
something that we don't. It's also incredibly easy for us to put our feet up
and make excuses for why we won't do that today, or won't ever achieve that
thing.

"When you want to, you find a way. When you don't, you find an excuse."

We want to help figure out the real reason for those excuses. Is it self-doubt,
lack of confidence, not knowing how to actually get there, or is it because we really
don't want it. 

Sometimes we're trapped in patterns where we are chasting things, not because we want them,
but because others want them, or want them for us. Sometimes we simply want conflicting things
and the big thing that takes work seems so much more unattainable than the small thing
right in front of us that we can achieve, but will make the big thing even more unattainable. 

We believe strongly in Carl Rogers' Person Centered Therapy and bring that into how we
aim to connect with you, believe in you, and support you through whatever time you choose
to spend with us. 

Some of the more frequent arenas in which people are engaging us are broken out
on our site, but this is not at all a limitation on where we may be able to help
you. Even if we haven't specifically talked about what you are wanting to
address for, and within yourself, ask. We will honestly let you know if we
think we can, or can't, help. 


Whichever arenea you enter through, whatever you feel you need most to start, the work
underneath has a lot of the same structure: helping you discover who you are, develop the
parts of yourself that haven't had room to grow yet, and become more
fully, honestly yourself, and to start and keep moving toward those things you want. It
is not unusual to find yourself wanting to move other areas of yourself forward as well.


You can't know your way to a destination, you have to put in the work. We're
here to help you uncover the things you actually want enough to be doing the
work to achieve.

We're not about buzzwords, or trendy 'secrets'. We're here to support you
in doing the the real work.
